 "_doc": "THE single-player mission table (sp3camp). One row per mission; warmap.py (pins, tags, legend) and make_ng3campaigns.py (tags, locks, difficulty screens, flat chooser, coop_mod/spcampaign_table.scr) read only this. Add a mission = add a row (and its campaign if new). pin = the real place (lat, lon); tag = where its paper tag hangs on the wall view (lat, lon; warmap QA asserts it clears every pin, name, tag, the toggle and the legend). chrono = position in the chronological order (coop_mod/chrono.scr / chrono_campaign ORDER.md). last = the mission's last level(s): finishing it in SP marks the mission done. optional_cvar = the mission exists only when this cvar is 1 (e.g. content converted on the player's machine): every widget of it is gated on it, and a mission whose predecessor is optional and absent unlocks from the one before. byo (optional missions only) = map, the coop_byoAll token of its level and of its briefing room (engine Com_ByoTokens), its title and game: make_ng3campaigns.py writes coop_mod/byo_campaign.scr (campaign routing into and out of it) from these rows.",
